//! The `text-emphasis-style` [CSS](https://developer.mozilla.org/en-US/docs/Web/CSS) property sets
//! the appearance of emphasis marks. It can also be set, and reset, using the `text-emphasis`
//! shorthand.
//!
//! Initial: none. Inherited: yes.
//! Percentages: not accepted.
